# The engines, one step of ALGORITHM each: each names its knobs after what they do on it (Plaits'
# manual), and plays; breath still opens our filter. 6-op's Ratio is its patch, by the DX7's name. The
# Engine page holds the engine's Harmonics, Timbre and Morph (named for what they do on it) and Aux.
wait 200
tap HOME
expect view 1
expect par30 0
expect title Classic
# Classic: no Ratio or Index; Morph is its waveform
expect knob1 -
expect knob2 -
expect knob3 Morph
# Aux (Plaits' AUX output, Classic's high-pass) on knob 4, off to start
expect knob4 Aux
expect par60 0
midi 90 39 64
breath 0 127 50
wait 50
expect level >5
spin ALGO 1
expect msg1 FM
expect knob1 Ratio
expect knob2 Index
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 2
expect msg1 6-op
expect knob1 Patch
expect knob2 Bright
# 6-op's AUX is its main output: no Aux knob
expect knob4 -
# the patch: its number on the knob, its name in the message; BRASS 6 BC (95 of 96) to start with
expect par47 94
spin K1 1
expect par47 95
expect msg0 Patch
expect msg1 BR_TRUMPET
spin K1 1
expect par47 95
spin K1 -1
expect msg1 BRASS_6_BC
breath 127 127 200
wait 100
shot sixop.png
expect level >5
spin ALGO 1
expect msg1 Formant
expect knob1 Ratio
expect knob2 Formant
wait 100
expect level >5
spin ALGO 1
expect msg1 Waveshape
expect knob1 Shape
expect knob2 Fold
wait 100
expect level >5
spin ALGO 1
expect msg1 VA
expect knob1 Detune
expect knob2 Square
expect par30 5
expect title VA
wait 100
expect level >5
shot va.png
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 6
expect msg1 PD
expect knob1 Ratio
expect knob2 Amount
wait 100
expect level >5
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 7
expect msg1 Harmonic
expect knob1 Bumps
expect knob2 Peak
wait 100
expect level >5
shot harmonic.png
# the end of the list
spin ALGO 1
expect par30 7
# Morph, on the Engine page, takes the engine's name too
expect view 1
expect knob3 Shape
# breath to cutoff still works on every engine
breath 127 10 50
wait 60
breath 10 10 10
expect cutoff <30
midi 80 39 00
wait 200
# the patch stays with the sound across a restart
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
expect par30 2
spin K1 -5
wait 5000
reboot
wait 200
expect par30 2
expect par47 89
# turning ALGORITHM redraws the Engine page each step: its title, knob names and values, nothing left over
# from the engine before (Formant, Waveshape, VA, PD and Harmonic share their knobs' values)
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
wait 100
expect par30 0
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
spin ALGO 1
wait 100
expect stale 0
expect title Harmonic
